<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50760" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĕternōsus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		veternus, II. C., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>afflicted with lethargy</i>, <i>lethargic.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 20, 4,
				13, § 24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">28, 17, 67, §
			230</span></i>; Cato ap. <i><span class="en">Gell. 1, 15, 9</span></i>; id. ap. <i><span class="en">Fest. p.
				369</span></i>. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>sleepy</i>, <i>drowsy</i>, <i>dreamy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">homo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Eun. 4, 4, 21</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>languid</i>, <i>spiritless</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ira, 1, 16, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genus dicendi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 1, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">consuetudo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug.
					Ep. 48</span></i>
			.—<i>Sup.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">veternosissimi artificii nodos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 82, 19</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
